 and then we basically ventured into additional value

145
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:20,560
 added services, such as on-ramp or framp,

146
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:24,400
 staking, access to trading venues, et cetera.

147
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:27,640
 - Let me focus on some of the things

148
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,600
 you just mentioned, Alessio.

149
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:32,000
 So, if you ask many people in the crypto community,

150
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,440
 many people will tell you custody is becoming commoditized.

151
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,640
 It's gonna be service people will just offer,

152
