00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:11,520
 to allow you to delegate your funds to a node,

270
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:14,360
 a validator node in that specific blockchain protocol.

271
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:18,400
 This is exactly what staking is about.

